    {
      "text": "```html\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\" /\u003e\n    \u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" /\u003e\n    \u003ctitle\u003e极简 Todo 应用\u003c/title\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        /* ---------- 全局样式 ---------- */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 卡片容器 ---------- */\n        #app {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            max-width: 540px;\n            width: 100%;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            padding: 32px 28px 28px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10), 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n            transition: box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        #app:hover {\n            box-shadow: 0 24px 72px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 标题 ---------- */\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #1a1a2e;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n        }\n\n        h1 span {\n            background: #4f46e5;\n            color: #fff;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n            line-height: 24px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            margin-left: auto;\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 输入区域 ---------- */\n        .input-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n        }\n\n        #taskInput {\n            flex: 1;\n            padding: 12px 18px;\n            border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;\n            border-radius: 14px;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            outline: none;\n            transition: border 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;\n            background: #f9fafb;\n        }\n\n        #taskInput:focus {\n            border-color: #4f46e5;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n\n        #taskInput::placeholder {\n            color: #9ca3af;\n        }\n\n        #addBtn {\n            padding: 12px 24px;\n            background: #4f46e5;\n            color: #fff;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 14px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.15s;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n        }\n\n        #addBtn:hover {\n            background: #4338ca;\n        }\n\n        #addBtn:active {\n            transform: scale(0.96);\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 过滤器 ---------- */\n        .filters {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            background: #f3f4f6;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .filter {\n            flex: 1;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n            user-select: none;\n        }\n\n        .filter:hover {\n            color: #374151;\n        }\n\n        .filter.active {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 任务列表 ---------- */\n        #taskList {\n            list-style: none;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            max-height: 400px;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            padding-right: 4px;\n        }\n\n        #taskList::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 6px;\n        }\n\n        #taskList::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #d1d5db;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .task-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 12px;\n            padding: 10px 12px 10px 8px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            transition: background 0.2s, opacity 0.3s, transform 0.2s;\n            animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease;\n        }\n\n        .task-item:hover {\n            background: #f9fafb;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(6px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* 复选框 */\n        .task-check {\n            appearance: none;\n            width: 22px;\n            height: 22px;\n            border: 2px solid #d1d5db;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.2s, border 0.2s, transform 0.15s;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .task-check:checked {\n            background: #4f46e5;\n            border-color: #4f46e5;\n        }\n\n        .task-check:checked::after {\n            content: '✓';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            color: #fff;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n\n        .task-check:hover {\n            border-color: #4f46e5;\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n\n        /* 任务文本 */\n        .task-text {\n            flex: 1;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            word-break: break-word;\n            padding: 2px 0;\n            transition: color 0.25s, text-decoration 0.25s;\n        }\n\n        .task-item.completed .task-text {\n            text-decoration: line-through;\n            color: #9ca3af;\n        }\n\n        /* 创建时间（可选小字） */\n        .task-time {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #b0b7c3;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            display: none;\n            /* 默认隐藏，可取消注释显示 */\n        }\n\n        /* 删除按钮 */\n        .delete-btn {\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: #d1d5db;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 4px 6px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n            line-height: 1;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .delete-btn:hover {\n            background: #fee2e2;\n            color: #ef4444;\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 底部统计 ---------- */\n        .footer {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding-top: 16px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #6b7280;\n        }\n\n        #taskCount {\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        #clearCompleted {\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #9ca3af;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 6px 14px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        #clearCompleted:hover {\n            background: #fee2e2;\n            color: #ef4444;\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 空状态 ---------- */\n        .empty-state {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 32px 16px;\n            color: #b0b7c3;\n            font-size: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .empty-state::before {\n            content: '📋';\n            display: block;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* ---------- 响应式 ---------- */\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            #app {\n                padding: 24px 18px 20px;\n                border-radius: 20px;\n            }\n\n            h1 {\n                font-size: 24px;\n                margin-bottom: 18px;\n            }\n\n            #taskInput {\n                padding: 10px 14px;\n                font-size: 14px;\n            }\n\n            #addBtn {\n                padding: 10px 18px;\n                font-size: 14px;\n            }\n\n            .task-text {\n                font-size: 15px;\n            }\n\n            .filter {\n                font-size: 13px;\n                padding: 6px 0;\n            }\n        }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv id=\"app\"\u003e\n        \u003c!-- 标题 --\u003e\n        \u003ch1\u003e\n            Todo\n            \u003cspan id=\"itemCounter\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003c/h1\u003e\n\n        \u003c!-- 输入 --\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"input-group\"\u003e\n            \u003cinput type=\"text\" id=\"taskInput\" placeholder=\"添加新任务…\" autofocus /\u003e\n            \u003cbutton id=\"addBtn\"\u003e添加\u003c/button\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n\n        \u003c!-- 过滤器 --\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"filters\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"filter active\" data-filter=\"all\"\u003e全部\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"active\"\u003e待办\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"completed\"\u003e已完成\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n\n        \u003c!-- 列表 --\u003e\n        \u003cul id=\"taskList\"\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n        \u003c!-- 底部 --\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"footer\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan id=\"taskCount\"\u003e0 项未完成\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cbutton id=\"clearCompleted\"\u003e清除已完成\u003c/button\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cscript\u003e\n        (function() {\n            'use strict';\n\n            // ---------- DOM 引用 ----------\n            const taskInput = document.getElementById('taskInput');\n            const addBtn = document.getElementById('addBtn');\n            const taskList = document.getElementById('taskList');\n            const taskCount = document.getElementById('taskCount');\n            const itemCounter = document.getElementById('itemCounter');\n            const filters = document.querySelector('.filters');\n            const clearCompletedBtn = document.getElementById('clearCompleted');\n\n            // ---------- 状态 ----------\n            let tasks = []; // { id, text, completed, createdAt }\n            let currentFilter = 'all'; // 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\n\n            // ---------- 存储 ----------\n            const STORAGE_KEY = 'todo_app_data';\n\n            function loadTasks() {\n                try {\n                    const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n                    if (raw) {\n                        tasks = JSON.parse(raw);\n                        // 确保每个任务有 createdAt\n                        tasks = tasks.map(t =\u003e ({\n                            ...t,\n                            createdAt: t.createdAt || Date.now()\n                        }));\n                    } else {\n                        tasks = [];\n                    }\n                } catch (e) {\n                    tasks = [];\n                }\n            }\n\n            function saveTasks() {\n                try {\n                    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(tasks));\n                } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }\n            }\n\n            // ---------- 辅助函数 ----------\n            function generateId() {\n                return Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);\n            }\n\n            function formatTime(ts) {\n                const d = new Date(ts);\n                const h = d.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0');\n                const m = d.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0');\n                return `${h}:${m}`;\n            }\n\n            // ---------- 获取过滤后的任务 ----------\n            function getFilteredTasks() {\n                if (currentFilter === 'active') {\n                    return tasks.filter(t =\u003e !t.completed);\n                } else if (currentFilter === 'completed') {\n                    return tasks.filter(t =\u003e t.completed);\n                }\n                return tasks; // 'all'\n            }\n\n            // ---------- 统计 ----------\n            function updateStats() {\n                const total = tasks.length;\n                const activeCount = tasks.filter(t =\u003e !t.completed).length;\n                const completedCount = total - activeCount;\n\n                taskCount.textContent = `${activeCount} 项未完成`;\n                itemCounter.textContent = total;\n\n                // 控制“清除已完成”按钮的显示\n                clearCompletedBtn.style.display = completedCount \u003e 0 ? 'inline-block' : 'none';\n            }\n\n            // ---------- 渲染 ----------\n            function render() {\n                const filtered = getFilteredTasks();\n\n                if (filtered.length === 0) {\n                    const msg = currentFilter === 'all' ? '还没有任务，添加一条吧 ✨' :\n                        currentFilter === 'active' ? '没有待办任务，真棒 🎉' :\n                        '还没有已完成的任务';\n                    taskList.innerHTML = `\u003cdiv class=\"empty-state\"\u003e${msg}\u003c/div\u003e`;\n                } else {\n                    let html = '';\n                    filtered.forEach(task =\u003e {\n                        const checked = task.completed ? 'checked' : '';\n                        const completedClass = task.completed ? 'completed' : '';\n                        // 可以选择显示创建时间，暂时隐藏\n                        // const time = formatTime(task.createdAt);\n                        html += `\n                            \u003cli class=\"task-item ${completedClass}\" data-id=\"${task.id}\"\u003e\n                                \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-check\" ${checked} /\u003e\n                                \u003cspan class=\"task-text\"\u003e${escapeHtml(task.text)}\u003c/span\u003e\n                                \u003cbutton class=\"delete-btn\" title=\"删除任务\"\u003e✕\u003c/button\u003e\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                        `;\n                    });\n                    taskList.innerHTML = html;\n                }\n\n                // 更新过滤器高亮\n                document.querySelectorAll('.filter').forEach(el =\u003e {\n                    const filterVal = el.getAttribute('data-filter');\n                    if (filterVal === currentFilter) {\n                        el.classList.add('active');\n                    } else {\n                        el.classList.remove('active');\n                    }\n                });\n\n                updateStats();\n            }\n\n            // 简单的防 XSS\n            function escapeHtml(text) {\n                const div = document.createElement('div');\n                div.textContent = text;\n                return div.innerHTML;\n            }\n\n            // ---------- 核心操作 ----------\n            function addTask(text) {\n                const trimmed = text.trim();\n                if (!trimmed) return false;\n\n                const newTask = {\n                    id: generateId(),\n                    text: trimmed,\n                    completed: false,\n                    createdAt: Date.now()\n                };\n                tasks.unshift(newTask); // 新任务放在最前面\n                saveTasks();\n                render();\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            function deleteTask(id) {\n                tasks = tasks.filter(t =\u003e t.id !== id);\n                saveTasks();\n                render();\n            }\n\n            function toggleTask(id) {\n                const task = tasks.find(t =\u003e t.id === id);\n                if (task) {\n                    task.completed = !task.completed;\n                    saveTasks();\n                    render();\n                }\n            }\n\n            function clearCompleted() {\n                tasks = tasks.filter(t =\u003e !t.completed);\n                saveTasks();\n                render();\n            }\n\n            function setFilter(filter) {\n                if (filter === currentFilter) return;\n                currentFilter = filter;\n                render();\n            }\n\n            // ---------- 事件绑定 ----------\n\n            // 添加按钮\n            addBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n                const text = taskInput.value;\n                if (addTask(text)) {\n                    taskInput.value = '';\n                    taskInput.focus();\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 回车添加\n            taskInput.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {\n                if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    addBtn.click();\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 任务列表事件代理（切换完成 / 删除）\n            taskList.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n                const target = e.target;\n\n                // 复选框切换\n                if (target.classList.contains('task-check')) {\n                    const li = target.closest('.task-item');\n                    if (li) {\n                        const id = li.getAttribute('data-id');\n                        toggleTask(id);\n                    }\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                // 删除按钮\n                if (target.classList.contains('delete-btn')) {\n                    const li = target.closest('.task-item');\n                    if (li) {\n                        const id = li.getAttribute('data-id');\n                        deleteTask(id);\n                    }\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                // 点击任务文本也可以切换（可选功能）\n                if (target.classList.contains('task-text')) {\n                    const li = target.closest('.task-item');\n                    if (li) {\n                        const id = li.getAttribute('data-id');\n                        toggleTask(id);\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 过滤器切换\n            filters.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n                const filterSpan = e.target.closest('.filter');\n                if (!filterSpan) return;\n                const filter = filterSpan.getAttribute('data-filter');\n                if (filter) {\n                    setFilter(filter);\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 清除已完成\n            clearCompletedBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n                clearCompleted();\n            });\n\n            // ---------- 初始化 ----------\n            loadTasks();\n            render();\n\n            // 聚焦输入框\n            if (taskInput) taskInput.focus();\n\n        })();\n    \u003c/script\u003e\n\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
